@startuml

title Secure Introduction: the states a workload passes through before it holds a token

skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

[*] --> Unidentified : the platform delivers the unit's key pair
Unidentified --> Challenged : asks for a challenge, naming itself
Challenged --> Proven : returns the nonce only its key could open
Proven --> Provisioned : the store seals its own secret to that key
Provisioned --> Authenticated : signs in with the secret it resolved
Authenticated --> [*] : the unit stops

note bottom of Challenged
  Good once, for a short time, and sealed
  to the registered key.
end note

note bottom of Provisioned
  Nothing plaintext crosses the bus.
end note

@enduml
